From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sample Agent <agent@example.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fetch: retry transient failures with exponential backoff

Busy feed servers answer 503 or 429 now and then, and kestrel gave up
on the first error. Retry those, and connection errors, up to three
times with exponential backoff. --retries 0 turns it off.
